{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>היתה לי.</b> Like תהיה לי." "<b>עדנה.</b> Like עדן and ענג, and so ויתעדנו (Nehemiah 9:25), and the meaning is: after I have withered and grown old, how can pleasure and delight of youth be renewed in me, and also that my master is old," "And the meaning is in her inward soul, and HaShem revealed her secret to the angel."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:56.411652008Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}